  "title": "Parmesan-Encrusted Pine Nuts",
  "description": "These candied pine nuts coated with sugar and nutty Parmesan cheese are a quick and easy salad topper that will wow the whole family.",
  "authors": [
    "JAILORMOON"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:54:03-04:00",
